// Eraser flowchart source. Paste into an Eraser diagram (Flow chart).
direction right

Tap [shape: oval, icon: crosshair, label: "Tap (hit-test + camera frame)"]
Crop [icon: crop, label: "Crop 224x224"]
Edge [icon: smartphone, label: "SigLIP q8 on device"]
Decide [shape: diamond, icon: git-branch, label: "confidence >= t?"]
Cloud [icon: cloud, label: "VLM via OpenAI-compatible API"]
Match [icon: check, label: "Match to categories"]
Anchor [shape: oval, icon: map-pin, label: "Label on XR anchor"]

Tap > Crop > Edge > Decide
Decide > Anchor: yes
Decide > Cloud: no
Cloud > Match > Anchor
